{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IOQLpyE4BZ1794883612.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>第33屆亞太經合組織（APEC）領導人非正式會議將於11月18日至19日在廣東深圳舉行。據新華社報道，隨着盛會臨近，深圳已披上節日盛裝，全城點綴着鮮花與翠綠植物，並將APEC元素巧妙融入城市景觀，營造出濃厚的國際交流氛圍。<br/></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.15\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KDj6q3b1Si1794883163.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.14\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026B97O8Nim2D1794883163.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.10\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026L4SxKVc6uj1794883162.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.05\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202677EDhEARaa1794883161.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.01\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026y4dGaOeHoy1794883160.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>繁花綠植點綴　城市面貌煥然一新</strong></p><p></p><p>連日來，深圳多個地標及公共空間煥然一新。從深圳國際交流中心的外觀，到福田區的璀璨夜景，整座城市在花卉與綠植的裝點下展現出勃勃生機。工作人員亦在街頭加緊佈置，為城市增添節慶色彩，迎接即將到來的亞太區貴賓。<br/></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.02\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Zpxgs6jD671794883160.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.04\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ynotTs6aMS1794883161.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.06\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263okRCKptZL1794883161.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.08\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265GkRPuT2k81794883162.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.11\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JKbgNWmLXh1794883162.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><strong>主題裝置處處　市民遊客爭相打卡</strong></p><p></p><p>為呼應APEC「中國年」，深圳街頭設置了多個極具特色的APEC主題裝置與裝飾。在香蜜湖路，沿線佈滿了醒目的主題裝飾；南山區的深圳人才公園內，精美的主題裝置吸引不少女士駐足自拍留念。此外，崗廈北地鐵站以及深圳北站東廣場等交通樞紐，均設置了大型APEC主題裝置，不少市民和旅客經過時紛紛停下腳步，合影留念，感受盛會帶來的喜悅與自豪。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.03\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026e0RcwvJrgV1794883161.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.07\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RIpcXI2umV1794883161.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.12\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Syw1dN4lV31794883162.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.13\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TP8yoWnetm1794883163.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"APEC SZ.XINHUA.09\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CoRDnIy4ZJ1794883162.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:47:52.538937+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":410,"images":16,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T02:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:10:22.613238+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:41:00.571923+00:00","content_hash":"04a8f967514562400d9d92b094049c3f150ed2d2aa1d5785f283ac1b146cb1ce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:47:52.538937+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}